{
  "version": 3,
  "name": "UREI LA-3A",
  "category": "Dynamics",
  "author": "LiveWDF",
  "description": "UREI drawing C/1186 Rev E. The T4B optical shunt, direct transistor voltage amp, complementary line driver and separate transformer-coupled EL driver follow the service topology. The optical panel and CdS history use a two-branch approximation. Generic PNP output transport and nominal linear equivalents represent the 2N4037 pair and original transformer windings. Balanced line connections are ground-referenced. Meter, link and mains supply are omitted.",
